1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,950
There are three ways to start.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:05,340
Blank Project starts an empty IDM.

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:09,442
Use it to author a new IDM; we will use it in part five.

4
00:00:10,342 --> 00:00:15,377
Sample Project opens a complete example IDM, useful to explore the app.

5
00:00:16,277 --> 00:00:26,154
Open Project opens an IDM you already have: a project file, an idmXML file, an IDS, or a BPMN diagram.

6
00:00:27,054 --> 00:00:28,370
Click Blank Project.

7
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:34,158
The new IDM has a header, a use case, and a process map with one pool and a start event.

